<https://uitf/ISLK302> a acc:Aperture ;
    acc:FloorP <https://uitf/ISLK302/FloorP> ;
    acc:LongitudinalPlacementP <https://uitf/ISLK302/LongitudinalPlacementP> ;
    acc:MetaP <https://uitf/ISLK302/MetaP> ;
