    acc:MetaP <https://uitf/MFHK101/MetaP> ;
    acc:ReferenceP <https://uitf/MFHK101/ReferenceP> ;
    acc:SolenoidP <https://uitf/MFHK101/SolenoidP> ;
    acc:TwissP <https://uitf/MFHK101/TwissP> ;
